### ?? Field Definitions

#### 1. Top-Level Root
* **`version`** *(Int, Required)*: Must be `2`.
* **`priorityPartyId`** *(String/UUID, Optional)*: UUID string of the party set as priority, or `null`.
* **`members`** *(Array, Required)*: List of master template objects.
* **`parties`** *(Array, Required)*: List of party encounter objects.

#### 2. Master Member Template (`members[]`)
* **`id`** *(String/UUID)*: 36-character UUID string (e.g. `"42c64059-ddad-4f0e-9d3f-ae574dbd1b9f"`).
* **`name`** *(String)*: Name of the member or monster.
* **`isPC`** *(Boolean)*: `true` for Player Characters, `false` for Monsters/NPCs.
* **`classLevels`** *(String)*: E.g., `"Fighter 4"` or `"Ranger 3"`.
* **`thac0`** *(Int)*: Default `20`.
* **`armorClass`** *(Int)*: Default `10`.
* **`hitDice`** *(String)*: E.g. `"4d10+8"` or `"1d6"`.
* **`hpFull`** *(Int)*: Default template max HP.
* **`damageRolls`** *(String)*: E.g. `"1d8+2"` or `"1d6 | 1d4"`.
* **`specialDetections`** *(String or null)*: Special senses/detections.
* **`specialAttacks`** *(String or null)*: Special abilities or attacks.
* **`movement`** *(String or null)*: E.g. `"120' (40')"`.
* **`size`** *(String or null)*: E.g. `"S"`, `"M"`, `"L"`.
* **`xp`** *(Int)*: XP value.

#### 3. Party Encounter Object (`parties[]`)
* **`id`** *(String/UUID)*: Unique UUID string for the party.
* **`name`** *(String)*: Name of the party (e.g. `"Area 2 - Guard Post"`).
* **`isActive`** *(Boolean)*: Whether the party is active on the main screen.
* **`members`** *(Array)*: List of lightweight `PartyMember` instance references:
  * **`memberId`** *(String/UUID)*: Must match the `id` of the template in top-level `members[]`.
  * **`name`** *(String)*: Template name for cross-file reference safety.
  * **`hpCurrent`** *(Int)*: Current HP for this specific instance.
  * **`hpFull`** *(Int)*: Max HP override for this specific instance (or `0` to inherit template HP).
  * **`cloneTag`** *(String)*: `"\u0000"` or `"0"` for original non-clone; `"a"`, `"b"`, `"c"`... for clones.

